WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.013 --> 00:00:02.518
Issue markers and the discussion flag

2
00:00:02.518 --> 00:00:10.362
Put the cursor on the line you want to discuss

3
00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:15.183
Run Insert issue marker

4
00:00:15.183 --> 00:00:18.527
This sentence becomes the issue title; press Enter

5
00:00:18.527 --> 00:00:24.276
The marker is added and highlighted

6
00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:28.761
A marker typed by hand without an ID gets a wavy underline

7
00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:33.243
The pre-push check fails on it, so insert it again with the command

8
00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:40.178
To discuss the whole experiment, toggle the discussion flag

9
00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:51.429
README gets discuss on; the next push opens an issue
